{"title":"What should I ask George Selgin?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/922140476/0/marginalrevolution~What-should-I-ask-George-Selgin.html","date":1753381096000,"content":"<p>Yes, I will be having a Conversation with him, live at the Cato Institute on September 26th, here is some basic information:</p>\r\n<p><span>Website: </span><u><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.cato.org%2Fevents%2Ffalse-dawn-new-deal-promise-recovery-1933-1947&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C2611db74146747b62dcf08ddcac3109b%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C638889661344584701%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=akD5%2FY%2BLowJwCk7PcJI6TkvB0bhG3vrSa4PNS0c2pRM%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.cato.org/events/false-dawn-new-deal-promise-recovery-1933-1947</a></u></p>\r\n<p>Registration: <u><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fregister.cato.org%2Ffalse-dawn-new-deal-promise-recovery-1933-1947%2Fregister&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C2611db74146747b62dcf08ddcac3109b%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C638889661344611882%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=B22qgOgHs5l74YFRX%2FLM%2FvaRzj5%2FBg27LL5GxBbnrwI%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">https://register.cato.org/false-dawn-new-deal-promise-recovery-1933-1947/register</a></u></p>\r\n<p>We will start with George’s new and excellent book <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/False-Dawn-Recovery-1933-1947-Governments/dp/0226832937/ref=sr_1_1?crid=JP2C172TVFJZ&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.LvSqlQLe_iG6mVS9gP4Xw0PlWBqM8mP1MdUvnhazHDlHGkApSP6foxvdVqmHzFTQ325z4LcWT0QDGQKMMo1-w_EOfZZGXJ0i9DsGj-Bocalah-868oOVYxk2K-KgM1_946PZoPZGwPYgNTG536rTddPODaHYZ2FWsun5h7Nhd4k0YIijeSRDVcGNtICUXq7GoKT6c6pzBV1LE-j2XAbl99OcKN-E6HAYpRzaVT89SCg._ao8EslOmr5a5lrJWOTytmScOWAxphJxQcvWc0KtUjI&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=george+selgin&amp;qid=1753380973&amp;sprefix=george+selgin%2Caps%2C137&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">False Dawn: The New Deal and the Promise of Recovery 1933-1947</a>.  But of course George has a long and distinguished record in monetary economics, free banking, macro, and ngdp ideas, as well as productivity norms for monetary policy.</p>\r\n<p>So what should I ask him?</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/07/what-should-i-ask-george-selgin.html\">What should I ask George Selgin?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/922140476/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/922140476/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/922140476/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/922140476/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/922140476/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/922140476/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/07/what-should-i-ask-george-selgin.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"http